      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/5daacb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-11T12:14:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi. I picked up the oversized villain cards recently and was pleased to see the alternate versions of baron and omni included. These bring welcome variety to the decks.&nbsp;</p><p>Im curious to know if there are any plans to do a wider print run of the alternate hero cards? Some of these look really interesting.&nbsp;</p><p>Spiff's very awesome life counters do offer an opportunity to trial them but the collector in me would love to get hold of the real thing.&nbsp;</p><p>I guess what I'm saying is , dear GTG... would you like to take some more of my money?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:59.888Z",
